es\u002Fmailer","de\u002F3.user-guides\u002F6.mailer",{"title":150,"path":151,"stem":152},"Einstellungen","\u002Fde\u002Fuser-guides\u002Fsettings","de\u002F3.user-guides\u002F7.settings",{"title":154,"path":155,"stem":156},"Sprachen (i18n)","\u002Fde\u002Fuser-guides\u002Fi18n","de\u002F3.user-guides\u002F8.i18n",{"title":158,"path":159,"stem":160},"iOS-App","\u002Fde\u002Fuser-guides\u002Fios-app","de\u002F3.user-guides\u002F9.ios-app",{"title":162,"path":163,"stem":164},"StreamDeck Plugin","\u002Fde\u002Fuser-guides\u002Fplugin-streamdeck","de\u002F3.user-guides\u002F9.plugin-streamdeck",{"title":166,"path":167,"stem":168,"children":169},"Entwicklung","\u002Fde\u002Fdevelopment","de\u002F8.development\u002F1.index",[170,171,175],{"title":166,"path":167,"stem":168},{"title":172,"path":173,"stem":174},"User Activity","\u002Fde\u002Fdevelopment\u002Fuser-activity","de\u002F8.development\u002F5.user-activity",{"title":154,"path":176,"stem":177},"\u002Fde\u002Fdevelopment\u002Fi18n","de\u002F8.development\u002Fi18n",{"title":179,"path":180,"stem":181,"children":182},"Design","\u002Fde\u002Fdesign","de\u002F9.design\u002F1.index",[183],{"title":179,"path":180,"stem":181},{"id":185,"title":40,"body":186,"description":192,"extension":329,"links":330,"meta":331,"navigation":332,"path":333,"redirect":330,"seo":334,"stem":335,"__hash__":336},"content_en\u002F1.getting-started\u002F4.installation\u002F2.cloud.md",{"type":187,"value":188,"toc":319},"minimark",[189,193,196,201,230,234,245,248,252,267,271,312,316],[190,191,192],"p",{},"FiveNet Cloud is available today as a managed hosting option for communities that want us to run and maintain FiveNet for them.",[190,194,195],{},"The service is hosted by ZerBytes UG (haftungsbeschrankt).",[197,198,200],"h3",{"id":199},"why-choose-fivenet-cloud","Why Choose FiveNet Cloud",[202,203,204,212,218,224],"ul",{},[205,206,207,211],"li",{},[208,209,210],"strong",{},"Managed Hosting",": We run and maintain your FiveNet instance for you.",[205,213,214,217],{},[208,215,216],{},"Less Operational Overhead",": You do not need to build and maintain your own Docker or Kubernetes setup for FiveNet.",[205,219,220,223],{},[208,221,222],{},"Ongoing Updates",": We keep your FiveNet instance up to date as new releases become available.",[205,225,226,229],{},[208,227,228],{},"Direct Support",": Cloud customers can reach out through Discord support tickets for onboarding and operational questions.",[197,231,233],{"id":232},"what-you-still-need-to-provide","What You Still Need To Provide",[202,235,236,239,242],{},[205,237,238],{},"Access to the gameserver database that FiveNet should use.",[205,240,241],{},"The required plugin integration on your gameserver.",[205,243,244],{},"Any server-specific configuration needed for your community and framework.",[190,246,247],{},"FiveNet Cloud reduces the infrastructure work on your side, but you still need to connect it to your gameserver environment.",[197,249,251],{"id":250},"getting-started","Getting Started",[253,254,255,258,261,264],"ol",{},[205,256,257],{},"Join the FiveNet Discord.",[205,259,260],{},"Create a support ticket for FiveNet Cloud.",[205,262,263],{},"Share the details needed for your setup, such as your community, gameserver environment, and database connectivity.",[205,265,266],{},"We will guide you through onboarding and the remaining setup steps.",[197,268,270],{"id":269},"faqs","FAQs",[272,273,276,284,291,298,305],"card-group",{"className":274},[275],"sm:grid-cols-1",[277,278,281],"card",{"icon":279,"title":280},"i-mdi-database","What happens to my data?",[190,282,283],{},"Your gameserver database must be accessible to FiveNet. If you later switch to a self-hosted instance, you can request the attachment data, such as avatars.",[277,285,288],{"icon":286,"title":287},"i-mdi-currency-usd-off","Is there a free tier?",[190,289,290],{},"Currently, there is no free tier available for FiveNet.",[277,292,295],{"icon":293,"title":294},"i-mdi-cloud-upload","How do I migrate from self-hosted to cloud?",[190,296,297],{},"No full migration is required. Since your FiveNet data, such as citizens and documents, remains tied to your database, the main extra step is handling attachment data if needed.",[277,299,302],{"icon":300,"title":301},"i-mdi-cloud-download","How do I migrate from cloud to self-hosted?",[190,303,304],{},"Since FiveNet data, such as citizens and documents, is stored in your database, you mainly need a copy of the attachment data for your self-hosted instance. The FiveNet Cloud team can assist with this process.",[277,306,309],{"icon":307,"title":308},"i-mdi-tools","Do I still need technical setup on my side?",[190,310,311],{},"Yes. FiveNet Cloud removes most of the infrastructure work, but you still need to provide database access and complete the required plugin integration for your gameserver.",[197,313,315],{"id":314},"next-step","Next Step",[190,317,318],{},"Join the FiveNet Discord and create a cloud support ticket to get started with FiveNet Cloud. Our team can help with onboarding, setup questions, and migration planning.",{"title":320,"searchDepth":321,"depth":321,"links":322},"",2,[323,325,326,327,328],{"id":199,"depth":324,"text":200},3,{"id":232,"depth":324,"text":233},{"id":250,"depth":324,"text":251},{"id":269,"depth":324,"text":270},{"id":314,"depth":324,"text":315},"md",null,{},true,"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Finstallation\u002Fcloud",{"title":40,"description":192},"1.getting-started\u002F4.installation\u002F2.cloud","M84Q8MCY-jjvqNEWXcEl1kSYvi5-yQioBd4sxSzDUHY",[338,343],{"title":339,"path":340,"stem":341,"description":342,"children":-1},"Installation Methods","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Finstallation\u002Fmethods","1.getting-started\u002F4.installation\u002F1.methods","Choose the installation path that fits your environment, whether you want managed hosting with FiveNet Cloud or a self-hosted deployment with Docker or Kubernetes.",{"title":344,"path":345,"stem":346,"description":347,"children":-1},"Using Docker","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Finstallation\u002Fcontainer-docker","1.getting-started\u002F4.installation\u002F3.container-docker","Deploy FiveNet with Docker Engine and the Docker Compose plugin on a single server.",1788932306202]